<title>UK: Unilever up after Q1 profits rise.</title>
<headline>Unilever up after Q1 profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Unilever rose on Friday after the foods and household products group reported a seven percent rise in first quarter pre-tax profits.</p>
<p>&quot;The operating performance is clearly much better than the market had expected,&quot; said one analyst at a leading UK securities house.  </p>
<p>Unilever's shares gained 30-1/2p to 16.56 stg by 0845 GMT.</p>
<p>The company reported a pre-tax profit of 538 million stg. Analysts forecasts had been in range of 530 to 585 million stg.</p>
<p>-Andrew Langlands, London Newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
